✔ each runtime is one row with its state, its configuration owner and one next action (7.105291ms)
✔ empty, loading, failed and refreshing lists are four different readings (4.025834ms)
✔ opening a runtime moves the keyboard to its way back, and Back returns to the same row (42.0575ms)
